		 *      Column: non-Leaf
		 *      Table-Attribute: Leaf
		 *
		 * Create a service-def with following resource graph
		 *
		 *   Database -> UDF
		 *       |
		 *       v
		 *      Table -> Column
		 *         |
		 *         v
		 *        Table-Attribute
